    _es: El ataque aumenta en <color=#37B700>+{0}%</color> en la siguiente oleada.
    _vi: "T\u1EA5n c\xF4ng t\u0103ng <color=#37B700>+{0}%</color> \u1EDF \u0111\u1EE3t
      ti\u1EBFp theo."
  - _idx: str_upgrade_choice_desc_8
    _ko: "\uCD5C\uB300 \uCCB4\uB825\uC774 <color=#37B700>+{0}%</color> \uC99D\uAC00"
    _en: Max health increases by <color=#37B700>+{0}%</color>.
    _ja: "\u6700\u5927\u4F53\u529B\u304C<color=#37B700>+{0}%</color>\u5897\u52A0\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
