    _es: Evita ataques con cierta probabilidad
    _vi: "C\xF3 t\u1EC9 l\u1EC7 n\xE9 tr\xE1nh \u0111\xF2n t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng"
  - _idx: hero_desc_4
    _ko: "\uACF5\uACA9\uC744 \uAC00\uD560 \uC2DC \uD654\uC0C1\uC744 \uC785\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4"
    _en: Inflicts burn when attacking
