    _tw: "\u9AB0\u5B50\u653B\u64CA\u529B\u589E\u52A0<color=#37B700>{0}%</color>\u3002"
    _ru: "\u0410\u0442\u0430\u043A\u0430 \u043A\u0443\u0431\u0438\u043A\u043E\u0432
      \u0443\u0432\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0447\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F
      \u043D\u0430 <color=#37B700>{0}%</color>."
    _fr: "L\u2019attaque des d\xE9s augmente de <color=#37B700>{0}%</color>."
    _es: El ataque de los dados aumenta en <color=#37B700>{0}%</color>.
    _vi: "S\u1EE9c t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng x\xFAc x\u1EAFc t\u0103ng <color=#37B700>{0}%</color>."
  - _idx: str_levelup_dice_desc_7_3
    _ko: "HP <color=#37B700>{1}%</color> \uC774\uD558 \uC2DC \uD53C\uD574\uB7C9 +<color=#37B700>{0}%</color>"
    _en: Damage increased by <color=#37B700>{0}%</color> when HP is below <color=#37B700>{1}%</color>.
    _ja: "HP\u304C<color=#37B700>{1}%</color>\u4EE5\u4E0B\u306E\u6642\u3001\u30C0\u30E1\u30FC\u30B8\u304C<color=#37B700>{0}%</color>\u5897\u52A0\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    _de: "Wenn HP unter <color=#37B700>{1}%</color> liegt, erh\xF6ht sich der Schaden
      um <color=#37B700>{0}%</color>."
    _tw: "HP\u4F4E\u65BC<color=#37B700>{1}%</color>\u6642\uFF0C\u50B7\u5BB3\u589E\u52A0<color=#37B700>{0}%</color>\u3002"
    _ru: "\u041A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 HP \u043D\u0438\u0436\u0435 <color=#37B700>{1}%</color>,
      \u0443\u0440\u043E\u043D \u0443\u0432\u0435\u043B\u0438\u0447\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F
      \u043D\u0430 <color=#37B700>{0}%</color>."
    _fr: "Les d\xE9g\xE2ts augmentent de <color=#37B700>{0}%</color> lorsque les
      PV sont inf\xE9rieurs \xE0 <color=#37B700>{1}%</color>."
    _es: "El da\xF1o aumenta en <color=#37B700>{0}%</color> cuando el HP es inferior
      al <color=#37B700>{1}%</color>."
    _vi: "S\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u0103ng <color=#37B700>{0}%</color> khi HP d\u01B0\u1EDBi
      <color=#37B700>{1}%</color>."
  - _idx: str_levelup_dice_desc_7_4
    _ko: "HP <color=#37B700>{0}%</color> \uC774\uD558 \uC2DC \uBAA8\uB4E0 \uACF5\uACA9
      \uCE58\uBA85\uD0C0"
    _en: All attacks become critical when HP is below <color=#37B700>{0}%</color>.
